# D on an Upcoming entry adds a copy below it in the file, listed in the same day's group.
file <<END
- Plain @due({today+2})
- Other @due({today+1})
END
keys gU j
see ▌ - Plain
keys D x
see ✔ Plain
quit
saved <<END
- Plain @due({today+2})
- Plain @due({today+2}) @done({today})
- Other @due({today+1})
END
